/**
 * theme.js — plain design-token primitives.
 *
 * This replaces the old MUI `createTheme()` + `<ThemeProvider>` pair.
 * There is no theme *context* anymore: components import `theme` directly
 * and read the values they need out of it. This is the "existing theme
 * primitive file" the dashboard now pulls from — if your project already
 * has one, point the imports in Dashboard.jsx at it instead, as long as it
 * exposes the same shape (colors / radius / glass / typography).
 */

